# Ford Puma five-door crossover, 2019 onwards.
#
# The revived Puma: the B-segment five-door crossover on the Fiesta platform
# with the high waistline, the coupe-like roof and the 1.0 EcoBoost hybrid
# powertrain. UK prices were confirmed and First Edition orders opened in
# October 2019, with first deliveries in January 2020. This is NOT the 1997
# coupe; the two share only the name.
# https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ford_Puma_(crossover)
#
# Dimensions 4.186 x 1.805 x 1.537 m, wheelbase 2.588 m (Ford UK Puma
# brochure MY20.75, October 2020).
#
# Shape reference: NO true level side elevation exists. The side image is a
# front three-quarter about 35-40 degrees off, so the flank is estimated
# within the published dimensions and the limitation is recorded.
#
# Colours: grade (a), the Ford Puma UK brochure of June 2019: Blazer Blue
# standard; Frozen White, Race Red, Agate Black and Solar Silver premium.
# Weights 14, 12, 10, 8, total 44, provisional.
#
# Speed 190 km/h. Comfort 75/292, on the line 180 + 1.5 x 75. Classes 1,2.
# Dates: intro October 2019; retires staggered 2040-2043.
#
# Metres master: citycars/4.5/ford-puma-2019.blend. Interchange:
# citycars/4.5/ford-puma-2019.dae. References:
# citycars/references/ford-puma-2019/ (gitignored).
#
# Accepted deviations: no level side elevation exists, so the flank stations
# are estimated from oblique photographs within the published dimensions. The
# pre-facelift five-door crossover is modelled. The grille texture, lamp
# internals and lettering are simplified or omitted. The extended mirrors
# measure 1.996 m across against the brochure 1.930 m; the body meets the
# 1.805 m target.


obj=citycar
name=FordPuma2019(BlazerBlue)
copyright=JamesPetts

DistributionWeight=14
intro_year=2019
intro_month=10
retire_year=2043
retire_month=6
speed=190
class=1,2
maximum_comfortable_journey_minutes=75
maximum_tolerable_journey_minutes=292

Image[E]=./images/ford-puma-2019-blazerblue_E.0.0,-33,14
Image[SE]=./images/ford-puma-2019-blazerblue_SE.0.0,-13,0
Image[S]=./images/ford-puma-2019-blazerblue_S.0.0,0,0
Image[SW]=./images/ford-puma-2019-blazerblue_SW.0.0,-8,10
Image[W]=./images/ford-puma-2019-blazerblue_W.0.0,4,5
Image[NW]=./images/ford-puma-2019-blazerblue_NW.0.0,12,10
Image[N]=./images/ford-puma-2019-blazerblue_N.0.0,0,33
Image[NE]=./images/ford-puma-2019-blazerblue_NE.0.0,0,24
